{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗受罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["米利暗和亞倫因摩西娶了一個古實的女子而批評他，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「難道耶和華只藉著摩西說話嗎？祂不也藉著我們說話嗎？」耶和華聽見了這話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["其實摩西為人十分謙和，比世上任何人都謙和。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華突然對摩西、亞倫和米利暗說：「你們三人都出來到會幕去。」他們就去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華在雲柱中降臨，站在會幕門口呼喚亞倫和米利暗，二人就走到前面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華說：「你們聽我說，你們中間若有先知，我耶和華必在異象中向他顯現，在夢中跟他說話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但我不是這樣對待我的僕人摩西，他在我家裡忠信可靠，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我跟他面對面說話，清清楚楚，不用謎語，他看得見我的形像。你們怎敢批評我的僕人摩西？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華向他們發怒，然後離去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["雲彩從會幕上離開的時候，米利暗身上患了痲瘋病，像雪一樣白。亞倫見狀，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["便對摩西說：「我主啊，求你不要因我們愚昧犯罪而懲罰我們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["求你不要讓她像那一出母腹便半身腐爛的死胎。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["於是，摩西呼求耶和華：「上帝啊，求你醫治她！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「如果她父親在她臉上吐唾沫，她豈不也要蒙羞七天嗎？現在把她關在營外，七天後再讓她回來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["於是，米利暗被關在營外七天，民眾等她回營後才繼續前行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他們離開哈洗錄，到巴蘭曠野安營。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}